TASK-OPENVPM-SPRINT-5: Prescriptions & Medication Oversight UI Kit Harmonization

- Refactor apps/web/app/(dashboard)/prescriptions/page.tsx to the Page Kit
  hierarchy: PageHeader -> KpiGrid (4 KpiCard metrics: Aktívne / Končia do
  {days} dní / Po termíne / Strážca liekov) -> underline scope tabs
  (active, ending, overdue, controlled, alerts, all) -> PageToolbar
  (SearchField + results counter + clear-filter button) -> DataTableFrame
  (dense table: TableSkeleton while loading, EmptyState with "no
  prescriptions" vs "no search results" variants).
- Replace raw Tailwind colors with semantic tokens (primary/warning/
  destructive muted variants). OPL badge uses
  border-destructive/50 bg-destructive-muted text-destructive font-medium
  with ShieldAlert and links to /controlled-substances (Kniha OPL).
- Data is read exclusively from the existing tRPC queries:
  medicationOversight.summary.useQuery(undefined, { refetchInterval: 60_000 })
  and medicationOversight.list.useQuery({ scope, search, limit: 200, offset: 0 }).
- Clinical Guardian integration: summary.criticalAlerts /
  summary.openMedicationAlerts drive the Strážca liekov KPI; per-item
  guardianAlerts render as semantic destructive/warning chips.
- Add source-level contract test apps/web/lib/__tests__/prescriptions-ui.test.ts:
  Page Kit imports + hierarchy order, 4 KpiCard metrics, underline tabs for
  all six scopes, TableSkeleton/EmptyState inside DataTableFrame, no legacy
  Card component, no raw colors (text-emerald-*/text-amber-*/bg-sky-*),
  semantic token presence, tRPC query pins, 100% SK/EN i18n leaf-key and
  placeholder symmetry, and resolution of every i18n key used in the page.
- Add the 'prescriptions' i18n node to apps/web/messages/sk.json and
  apps/web/messages/en.json (45 leaf keys, 100% symmetric; veterinary
  terminology: "Dohľad nad liečivami", "Kniha OPL", "Ochranná lehota",
  "Dávkovanie"). All user-facing text goes through useI18n().

Verified in isolated workspace: vitest 14/14 passing, i18n leaf symmetry
45/45 keys with mutation detection, test file tsc --strict clean, page.tsx
syntax clean. NO changes to packages/db/schema/*.ts, _journal.json, or any
tRPC router.

Closes TASK-OPENVPM-SPRINT-5
